<title>UK: London Underground fares to rise four pct in 1997.</title>
<headline>London Underground fares to rise four pct in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Underground fares are to go up by an average of four pct from January 5, London Transport said in a statement.</p>
</text>
